体" >1.为啥要学数仓建模技术?&nbsp;</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库属于一个工程学科</font>, 在设计上要体现出工程的严谨性, </span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >而数据模型则是这门工程的核心基石</font>;</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >然后数据建模的设计需要有别于一般</font>OLTP系统, 当前两大主流建模理论分别为采用</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >【范式建模】</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >或</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >【维度建模】</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >进行数据模型设计；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1.1 提升数据组织与存储效率</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据模型是数据组织和存储的核心，通过合理的建模，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >可以将业务数据结构化，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >规范化，</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >使得数据在存储和查询时更加高效</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >；</font>&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1.2 支持业务分析与决策</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库建模是</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >支撑企业进行多维分析、生成报表和决策支持的基础</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。数据仓库模型能够打破信息孤岛，实现全公司范围内的数据共享与统一视图，为业务提供全面的数据支持。</font>&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1.3 促进数据治理与资产管理</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据建模不仅是技术问题，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >更是数据治理的重要组成部分。为啥这样说？</font>&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >建模过程中会建立统一的数据定义和标准，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >有助于提升数据质量，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >降低业务的使用成本；</font>&nbsp;通过建模过程，可以梳理业务数据，明确数据来源、用途和规则，形成可管理的企业数据资产。</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1.4 推动数据服务与系统建设</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库建模是构建数据服务系统的基础。</font>&nbsp;为啥这样说？&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据服务：</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据模型是数据服务</font>(如对外提供的数据查询接口，报表、BI工具 )的底层支撑</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，决定了数据如何被调用、展示和使用。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >系统建设：</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >比如元数据管理系统，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >任务调度系统等，</font> </span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >都需要依赖清晰的数据模型来设计和实现</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。</font>&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1.5 适应企业不同发展阶段的需求</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >业务不同阶段的发展，数据需求</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >从简单的数据报表逐步演变成精细化运营和智能决策</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >初期阶段：</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >可能只需要简单的数据汇总和报表，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >但随着业务深入，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >需要更复杂的数据模型来支持深度分析；</font>&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >长期发展：合理建模能够为企业数据架构打下基础，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >避免后期因模型混乱导致的重构成本；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >重点来了，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >学习数据仓库建模，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >不仅是为了掌握一门技术手段，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >更是为了理解如何将业务数据转换成可操作的数据结构，从而支撑企业的数据驱动决策和持续发展。无论是从业务分析、数据治理，还是系统建设的角度来看，数据建模都是不可或缺的核心能力。</font>&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >2.本门课程你会收获哪些？&nbsp;</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >2.1 数据仓库基础知识</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l4 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库概念、特点及与数据库的区别</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l4 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#